  "description": "lpath_key, the collision key of a logical path: its NFD form, then the NTFS upcase table of Windows 7 to 11 plus ς → Σ applied to each BMP character, then the NFC form. Characters above U+FFFF are unchanged. A path that is not valid UTF-8 has no key (NULL in the catalog). Only characters assigned in Unicode 16.0.",
